            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Good as written but I also made it following some review suggestions and it was even better. I diced the stems, cooked them in some of the bacon fat, added some chives and topped with breadcrumbs. I did need to put them under the broiler briefly to brown the crumbs but the crunch added a nice contrast. Really yummy. They disappeared.",
