            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cerena Charline Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used baby portobellos, and half a package of sausage instead of bacon. I also added a bit of mozzarella. I chopped the stems and added them to the sausage while I was cooking it, and I covered the inside and outsides of the mushrooms in garlic butter and baked them for 10 minutes before stuffing. I added a mixture of Parmesan and oat flour the last 5 minutes of baking. Yummy!!! One day I'll make them as written, because those look delicious, too! :)",
            "datePublished": "2017-08-09T16:44:17.183Z"
          },
          {
